  "title": "Air Fryer Tofu",
  "description": "These tofu bites made in the air fryer are quick and easy to make and come out super crispy--perfect as a vegan snack, a topping for a salad, or added to a stir-fry dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Bren"
  ],
